    <grid>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "name": "1 column layout",
  "sections": [
    {
      "grid": "12",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "309e2d4b-2d7d-4f87-ba89-b73f65ff57bf",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<p>The acquisition of a new and profoundly powerful particle size analyser marks a significant milestone in our commitment to excellence and innovation at Roadlab.</p>\n<p>With this mission in mind, we are thrilled to announce the latest addition to our laboratory equipment lineup: the Mastersizer 3000E from Malvern Panalytical. We are the only commercial facility with this capacity.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2604,
                    "udi": "umb://media/d86be2f16b9b43cdb1bf6e3a10fa29b7",
                    "image": "/media/45rgxwe1/mastersizer-image-1.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><em>The Mastersizer 3000E from Malvern Panalytical.</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "9d3ba9a4-eb3b-4dcf-a02a-be1e9be31f8e",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">What Is The Mastersizer 3000E?</span></p>\n<p>The Mastersizer 3000E is a state-of-the-art solution designed to deliver precise and reliable particle size measurements across a wide range of applications.</p>\n<p>Utilizing laser diffraction technology, the Mastersizer 3000E offers unparalleled accuracy and repeatability, ensuring precise measurements even for complex sample matrices.</p>\n<p>The Mastersizer 3000E is capable of accurately analyzing particle sizes ranging from 10 nanometers to 1 millimeter.</p>\n<p>With rapid measurement capabilities, the Mastersizer 3000E enables faster turnaround times without compromising accuracy.</p>\n<p>Its automated features minimize manual intervention, reducing the risk of errors and increasing productivity.</p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            },
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.519650655021834,
                      "top": 0.4657933042212518
                    },
                    "id": 2602,
                    "udi": "umb://media/1d4a1ff0ca6640bcaa5adf0b27f8c5d6",
                    "image": "/media/4ypfuhlg/mastersizer-background.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2608,
                    "udi": "umb://media/b958733bde6246f7a99508abde8f6277",
                    "image": "/media/hvzfrolc/mastersizer-3.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "51c1cd0c-48b2-41a9-be33-9b4eecbe8a08",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">How Will It Benefit Roadlab Clients?<br /></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Aggregate Testing</strong><br />In the field of aggregate testing, accurate particle size analysis is crucial for evaluating the quality and performance of construction materials. With the Mastersizer 3000E, we can much more precisely determine the particle size distribution of aggregates, helping our clients make informed decisions regarding material selection and optimization.</p>\n<p><strong>Soil Characterization</strong><br />In soil characterization efforts, understanding the particle size distribution is essential for assessing soil stability. By employing the Mastersizer 3000E, we can conduct thorough soil analysis with unmatched precision, providing valuable insights for environmental, engineering and construction projects.</p>\n<p><strong>Quality Control</strong><br />In addition to specific applications, the Mastersizer 3000E will play a pivotal role in our quality control processes across various testing procedures. This instrument will enable us to maintain stringent quality standards and ensure compliance with regulatory requirements.</p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "6d107414-7ca4-46df-b889-ef2db1f2c94f",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Our Technical Journey</span></p>\n<div class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_inlineleft  td_uid_12_633d70de2eeea_rand td_block_template_1\">\n<div class=\"td-visible-desktop\">\n<div id=\"beacon_1c824f1e1b\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; visibility: hidden;\"><img style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px;\" src=\"https://ads-za.privatelabel.co.za/www/delivery/lg.php?bannerid=1428&amp;campaignid=218&amp;zoneid=32&amp;loc=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.miningmx.com%2Fnews%2Fbase-metals%2F49235-vedanta-approves-r7bn-project-to-double-up-zinc-from-gamsberg-facilities-in-northern-cape%2F&amp;referer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F&amp;cb=1c824f1e1b\" alt=\"\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>By harnessing the capabilities of this advanced particle size analyzer, we are poised to deliver superior results and exceed the expectations of our clients across diverse industries.</p>\n<p>We remain dedicated to pushing the boundaries of laboratory testing and setting new benchmarks for quality, accuracy, and customer satisfaction.</p>\n<p>Stay tuned as we continue to leverage cutting-edge technologies to drive positive impact and create unmatched value for our clients.</p>\n<p><br /><em>- Janco Potgieter, Group Technical Manager</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            },
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2607,
                    "udi": "umb://media/c41a98ab6a24498ba7e0eabf7fb81d15",
                    "image": "/media/vwmbvrbe/janco.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
