    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of over 400 construction companies and 60 consulting firms. Our particle size analysis capabilities enable us to support their aggregate, soils and quality control needs.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
